senses.gloss:
शिग्रु = शोभाञ्जन
(1) MORINGA PTERYGOSPERMA GAERTN. (AFM 1, p. 91-93; Avk;
Bpn, p. 339-340; Chopra; Dgv, nr. 95; Dutt; DWH 1, p. 396-399;
Dy, p. 206-208; Gul; HB; HK; Kav; KB 1, p. 677-682; MW; Na 1,
nr. 129; Nadk. 1, nr. 1656; PA 1, 4, p. 19-33; PW; V 9, p. 100; Vśs)
= M. OLEIFERA LAM. (AFM 1, p. 91-93; Chopra; KB 1, p. 677-682;
Na 1, nr. 129; Nadk. 1, nr. 1656; PA 1, 4, p. 19-33) = HYPERANTHERA
MORINGA VAHL (Ainslie 1, p. 175-177; HK) [= H. MORINGA WILLD.]
(Dutt; Kav; Roxb., p. 360) = H. MORINGA (Nadk. 1, nr. 1656; Vśs;
Wise);
(2) MORINGA MORINGA (LINN.) MILLSP. = GUILANDINA MORINGA
LINN. (Avk; Nadk. 1, nr. 1656);
(3) MORINGA CONCANENSIS NIMMO EX DALZ. ET GIBS. (see Bpn, p.
340; Chopra: श्वेतशिग्रु; Dgv, nr. 95; KB 1, p. 682-683: तिक्तशिग्रु,
मधुशिग्रु, श्वेतशिग्रु; Na 1, nr. 129: कटुशिग्रु; Nadk. 1, nr. 1655:
used as a substitute; PA 1, 4, p. 19: मधुशिग्रु; V 10, p. 1).
